        "id": 47692,
        "name": "Pydro",
        "username": "Pydro",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pydro/{size}/1844_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-17T01:54:37.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Envisioner\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Envisioner:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>phantaskippy wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Anytime I play Ra, I'm always looking to pull off some kind of FotSG shenanigans, it is just too much fun, and my favorite card in his deck.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nMine is Wrathful Gaze.&nbsp; I long for the day when that will be my superstar card.&nbsp; Should try him against Apostate sometime, without Legacy or Fixer around.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Who needs Legacy and Fixer, just ignore the relics and focus on Apostate until he is at 2 or 1. Use Wrathful Gaze, game over.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:21:10.048Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
