      {
        "id": 47693,
        "name": "Envisioner",
        "username": "Envisioner",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-17T02:03:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>No, I said he needed to <em>not</em> have Legacy or Fixer around, or else Wrathful Gaze would be rendered moot by the bonuses to damage and/or removal of reduction.&nbsp; I had forgotten that WG thwarts Apostate's flip clause, though (I was thinking it was \"when Apostate is destroyed\" rather than \"when Apostate is reduced to 0 HP\")...that ends up kinda going back into \"lame game\" territory IMO.&nbsp; Hm, who else has lots of low-HP targets with heavy reduction?&nbsp; Dawn and Voss have a little of this, but it's not as consistent as Appley-Dappley tutoring up his Effigy/Runes combo.&nbsp; Perhaps Akash'bhuta in Pike Industries, in case a bunch of Biomemetic Vats come out?</p>",
